  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad62a80ce2d9e2f9",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们在 d1 决策模型家族中发布了两个开源决策模型：d1-3B 和 d1-omni-600M（实验性）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f316f2a4c37136d",
      "translationZh": "在 Decision Index 0.2.1 指标下，10B 以下性能最强的决策模型：d1-3B 得分为 48.57，领先于所有 4B 和 9B 模型以及 Decider 35B-A3B (47.11)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f60d7144cb2c345",
      "translationZh": "多模态：d1-3B 支持文本和图像，而 d1-omni-600M 支持文本和图像或文本和音频",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5f8631c21ddb883",
      "translationZh": "快速：d1-3B 在 NVIDIA Jetson AGX Thor 上回答问题仅需 16 毫秒，在 Jetson AGX Orin 上需 26 毫秒，在 Jetson Orin Nano 上需 50 毫秒",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "785a8b2b4c5a2532",
      "translationZh": "我们如何为边缘端构建决策模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38bb946b23ece4d8",
      "translationZh": "这些开源的 d1 决策模型是基于我们的 Liquid Foundation Models (LFMs) 构建的。与我们的生成式模型不同，决策模型不产生 token，而是通过单次前向传播进行回答。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8cd432ced517425",
      "translationZh": "d1-3B 和 d1-omni-600M 是基于两种截然不同的骨干网络训练而成的：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b9912d724d3cc5b",
      "translationZh": "d1-3B 是基于我们最新的 decoder-only VLM 模型 LFM2.5-VL-3B 训练的。它接受文本和图像作为输入。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83d1914954b5b9c0",
      "translationZh": "d1-omni-600M 是基于 LFM2.5-Encoder-350M（一个双向编码器）训练而成的。它增加了视觉和音频编码器以处理所有三种模态。它接受文本加图像，或文本加音频作为输入。该模型目前处于早期研究发布阶段，正在进行进一步开发。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c7d20824eaa3a66e",
      "translationZh": "基准测试结果",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d16ad6082bd2b0db",
      "translationZh": "我们在涵盖阅读理解、毒性检测、意图分类、医学问答和跨语言理解的七个公开数据集上对 d1-3B 和 d1-omni-600M 进行了基准测试。d1-3B 实现了 82.9 的平均分，为表中最高，且超过了 Decider 4B。d1-omni-600M 得分为 78.4，仅用四分之一的参数量就超越了 Decider 2B (77.1)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fa330e271ba9b77",
      "translationZh": "基准测试",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0f7b924a29da091",
      "translationZh": "文明评论",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59c412f03b4eb33e",
      "translationZh": "MASSIVE 意图",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "727a7d114f4d518e",
      "translationZh": "平均值",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2b33934d3653d68",
      "translationZh": "我们验证了 d1-3B 在标准视觉基准测试中保留了其 LFM2.5-VL-3B 骨干网络的视觉能力，并且 d1-omni-600M 可以处理所有三种模态。我们没有报告任何视觉或音频基准测试，因为 Decision Index v0.3 仅包含一个私有的视觉划分，且音频决策基准测试目前仍是一个开放性问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c372fee9b4566b85",
      "translationZh": "速度",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cff295df4e03c8f",
      "translationZh": "通过与 NVIDIA 合作，我们在 NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090、NVIDIA Jetson AGX Thor、Jetson AGX Orin 64 GB 和 Jetson Orin Nano 等 NVIDIA 技术栈上评估了 d1-3B。由于 d1-omni-600M 是早期研究版本，我们在此版本中没有报告其任何速度数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6aad0b96cea3b0d0",
      "translationZh": "边缘推理。d1-3B 在每个测试设备上回答单个问题的时间均在 50 毫秒以内。回答三个问题所需的时间仅为回答一个问题的 1.3 倍，其中 AGX Thor 从 16 毫秒增加到 20 毫秒。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "457efe3601b70ccf",
      "translationZh": "一个问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
