    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "940610cc30fb2f6f",
      "translationZh": "如何使用开放 d1 决策模型",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e5452fe39d198c3",
      "translationZh": "当您需要快速、结构化的决策（包括多模态输入）时，请选择 d1 决策模型。d1-3B 在其规模下提供最高的决策质量，而 d1-omni-600M 则适用于对占用空间有要求的场景。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f131cd40c237eb0",
      "translationZh": "安装依赖项（需要 transformers>=5.14）：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a62798b59c4cfc9f",
      "translationZh": "这些模型自带代码，因此加载时需设置 trust_remote_code=True：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbca2317a0b2e6f4",
      "translationZh": "为简洁起见，我们仅包含 d1-3B 的示例。有关如何运行 d1-omni-600M 模型的说明，请参阅该模型卡片。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "73b46c3cb292b17c",
      "translationZh": "开始使用 open d1 决策模型",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d85fc4a4c8e65685",
      "translationZh": "这两个决策模型均为开放权重，目前已在 Hugging Face 上可用：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
